{"url": "/about", "w": 375, "h": 812, "mode": "full", "sections": [{"id": "6722614383a465349885d411", "theme": "white-bold", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle white-bold", "style": "padding-top: 82px;", "rect": [0, 658], "minHeight": "0px", "padTop": "82px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "cwPad": ["0px", "0px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": false, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-73a1a6fa8c38c9eb337f", "area": "8 / 2 / 10 / 8", "z": "1", "rect": [23, 250, 248, 48], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "center", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"25.3542px\" data-lh=\"24.8682px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">About Vandra™</h2>", "htmlRect": [23, 262, 248, 25]}, {"id": "fe-block-16f7c2bb888eeebff101", "area": "10 / 2 / 13 / 8", "z": "4", "rect": [23, 298, 248, 72], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"11px\" data-lh=\"13.42px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Vandra™ takes its name from the Swedish word <em data-fw=\"500\">vandra</em>, meaning “to hike” or “to wander.” This simple yet powerful word reflects our core belief that exploring the outdoors is a vital part of a balanced life.</p>", "htmlRect": [23, 298, 248, 67]}], "kind": "fluid", "rows": 24, "rowH": "24px", "gap": "0px", "feH": 576}, {"id": "6722614383a465349885d417", "theme": "white-bold", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle white-bold", "style": null, "rect": [658, 409], "minHeight": "0px", "padTop": "0px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "cwPad": ["0px", "0px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": false, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-13ed70b4af937b08923c", "area": "4 / 2 / 7 / 9", "z": "2", "rect": [23, 763, 287, 94], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"11px\" data-lh=\"13px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">At Vandra™, we honor these Scandinavian ideals through minimalist design, sustainable materials, and thoughtful functionality—ensuring our products support you on every journey. Whether you’re an avid hiker exploring new trails or simply looking to bring a bit of Nordic calm to your daily life, we invite you to embrace the essence of vandra and discover your own path forward.</p>", "htmlRect": [23, 763, 287, 91]}, {"id": "fe-block-5fc685a6a6772e525d75", "area": "3 / 2 / 5 / 10", "z": "1", "rect": [23, 728, 330, 59], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"30px\" data-lh=\"27.0259px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Mission</h1>", "htmlRect": [23, 728, 330, 27]}, {"id": "fe-block-62abc59fb9ef112bd9ef", "area": "9 / 2 / 13 / 9", "z": "3", "rect": [23, 938, 287, 129], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"11px\" data-lh=\"13px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">At Vandra™, we envision a world where everyone discovers the simple joy of wandering in nature. Guided by Scandinavian values of sustainability, minimalism, and respect for the outdoors, our goal is to inspire a global community that embraces exploration, nurtures the environment, and brings a sense of calm to everyday life—no matter where the path leads.</span></p>", "htmlRect": [23, 938, 287, 91]}, {"id": "fe-block-6c179e7ae519bc9729ff", "area": "8 / 2 / 10 / 5", "z": "2", "rect": [23, 903, 117, 59], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "flex-start", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"30px\" data-lh=\"27.0259px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\" data-color=\"rgb(147, 149, 152)\" data-td=\"none\" data-fw=\"500\">Vision</span></h1>", "htmlRect": [23, 903, 117, 27]}], "kind": "fluid", "rows": 12, "rowH": "24px", "gap": "11px", "feH": 409}, {"id": "6722614383a465349885d414", "theme": "light", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignment--middle light", "style": "min-height: 1vh;", "rect": [1067, 561], "minHeight": "8.12px", "padTop": "0px", "padBot": "0px", "bgc": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "cwPad": ["0.812px", "0.812px", "0px", "0px"], "cwStyle": "padding-top: calc(1vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(1vmax / 10);", "bg": null, "overlay": null, "inFooter": false, "blocks": [{"id": "fe-block-5f975dd90bc689c69303", "area": "1 / 2 / 7 / 10", "z": "2", "rect": [23, 1068, 330, 199], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "center", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"25.3542px\" data-lh=\"24.8682px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Whether you’re an avid hiker exploring new trails or simply looking to bring a bit of Nordic calm to your daily life, we invite you to embrace the essence of <em data-fw=\"500\">vandra</em> and discover your own path forward.</h2>", "htmlRect": [23, 1068, 330, 199]}, {"id": "fe-block-yui_3_17_2_1_1739369459115_23832", "area": "7 / 2 / 11 / 10", "z": "4", "rect": [23, 1267, 330, 96], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block html-block", "jc": "center", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "html": "<p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-fs=\"11px\" data-lh=\"13.42px\" data-m=\"0px 0px\" data-col=\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Born in the heart of Scandinavia, our ethos is shaped by the region’s long-standing traditions of enjoying nature in all its forms—like Norway’s “tura” culture of everyday adventures, Finland’s spirit of overcoming the rugged outdoors, and Sweden’s love for camping and fishing in pristine forests and lakes. These customs have taught us that stepping outside, even for a short wander, can bring clarity, joy, and a sense of connection to the world around us.</p>", "htmlRect": [23, 1268, 330, 94]}, {"id": "fe-block-60d43b742bca69e2c590", "area": "12 / 2 / 22 / 10", "z": "3", "rect": [23, 1387, 330, 240], "type": "sqs-block website-component-block image-block", "jc": "center", "ai": "normal", "fd": "column", "pad": "0px", "disp": "block", "img": {"src": "DJI_0095.JPG", "fit": "cover", "radius": "0px", "pos": "50% 50%", "w": 330, "h": 240, "wrapRadius": "20px", "wrapOverflow": "hidden", "wrap": [23, 1387, 330, 240]}}], "kind": "fluid", "rows": 21, "rowH": "33.1562px", "gap": "0px", "feH": 559}, {"id": "682ce0530c97715f339e67eb", "theme": "light", "cls": "page-section full-bleed-section layout-engine-section background-width--full-bleed section-height--custom content-width--wide horizontal-alignment--center vertical-alignm